# Only the processor image is built with Docker (context = repo root).
# Whitelist what it needs; everything else (node_modules, .next, models,
# local data, secrets) stays out of the build context.
*
!processor/requirements.txt
!processor/app/
!processor/scripts/
!public/presets/
!public/brand/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
